nk it's gonna pivot anymore."},{"t":[197.4,198.1],"en":"You think?"},{"t":[201.4,204.7],"en":"All right, let's, uh, let's bring it back down and try again."},{"t":[204.8,205],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[205.7,206.3],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[213.1,214.9],"en":"Okay, yeah, I think it's really stuck now."},{"t":[214.9,219.1],"en":"I can't believe that didn't work."},{"t":[219.3,220.3],"en":"I know, me neither."},{"t":[221.1,222.3],"en":"I mean, it had a sketch."},{"t":[224.7,225.4],"en":"Oh, you know what?"},{"t":[225.4,226.6],"en":"What did you mean when you said pivot?"},{"t":[228.2,229.2],"en":"Turn this couch."},{"t":[229.3,230.8],"en":"I'm not satisfied with it."},{"t":[235.9,237.5],"en":"You want to return this couch?"},{"t":[240,241.4],"en":"It's cut in half."},{"t":[243.7,244.9],"en":"That's what I'm telling you."},{"t":[245.6,247],"en":"Did you cut this couch in half?"},{"t":[249.3,251.8],"en":"This couch is cut in half."},{"t":[253.5,257.5],"en":"I would like to exchange it for one that is not cut in half."},{"t":[259,262.4],"en":"You're telling me this couch was delivered to you like this?"},{"t":[262.6,264.4],"en":"Look, I'm a reasonable man."},{"t":[265.1,267],"en":"I will accept store credit."},{"t":[269,271.6],"en":"I'll give you store credit in the amount of $4."},{"t":[276.3,277.3],"en":"I will take it."}]}
